      "elements": [
        {"id": "s2_label", "type": "text", "content": "SPEAKER", "x": 160, "y": 60, "width": 300, "height": 24, "font_size": 14, "color": "#f69f02", "bold": true, "letter_spacing": 6},
        {"id": "s2_title", "type": "text", "content": "Daniel Carreon", "x": 160, "y": 100, "width": 800, "height": 90, "font_size": 72, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true},
        {"id": "s2_line", "type": "line", "x": 160, "y": 200, "width": 200, "height": 0, "x1": 160, "y1": 200, "x2": 360, "y2": 200, "color": "#f69f02", "line_width": 2},
        {"id": "s2_card1_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 160, "y": 240, "width": 780, "height": 95, "fill": "#111111", "corner_radius": 14, "stroke": {"color": "#f69f02", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#f69f02", "blur": 15, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s2_card1_txt", "type": "text", "content": "Mecatr\u00f3nica \u2192 Ciencia de Datos \u2192 3 a\u00f1os full time en IA", "x": 192, "y": 262, "width": 716, "height": 50, "font_size": 21, "color": "#DDDDDD"},
        {"id": "s2_card2_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 160, "y": 355, "width": 780, "height": 95, "fill": "#111111", "corner_radius": 14, "stroke": {"color": "#8C27F1", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#8C27F1", "blur": 15, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s2_card2_txt", "type": "text", "content": "SaaS Factory Community: 700+ miembros pagando cada mes", "x": 192, "y": 377, "width": 716, "height": 50, "font_size": 21, "color": "#DDDDDD"},
        {"id": "s2_card3_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 160, "y": 470, "width": 780, "height": 95, "fill": "#111111", "corner_radius": 14, "stroke": {"color": "#f69f02", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#f69f02", "blur": 15, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s2_card3_txt", "type": "text", "content": "$72,000+ USD procesados. Cero publicidad. Cero equipo.", "x": 192, "y": 492, "width": 716, "height": 50, "font_size": 21, "color": "#DDDDDD"},
        {"id": "s2_card4_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 160, "y": 585, "width": 780, "height": 95, "fill": "#111111", "corner_radius": 14, "stroke": {"color": "#8C27F1", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#8C27F1", "blur": 15, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s2_card4_txt", "type": "text", "content": "Software propio + 3 agentes IA + pipeline ML en producci\u00f3n", "x": 192, "y": 607, "width": 716, "height": 50, "font_size": 21, "color": "#DDDDDD"},
        {"id": "s2_footer_note", "type": "text", "content": "Todo lo que les muestro hoy est\u00e1 corriendo en producci\u00f3n ahora mismo.", "x": 160, "y": 740, "width": 800, "height": 40, "font_size": 18, "color": "#f69f02", "italic": true},
        {"id": "s2_photo", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 1100, "y": 240, "width": 660, "height": 440, "fill": "#2A2A2A", "corner_radius": 16, "stroke": {"color": "#f69f02", "width": 2}},
        {"id": "s2_photo_lbl", "type": "text", "content": "[FOTO SPEAKER]", "x": 1100, "y": 425, "width": 660, "height": 40, "font_size": 18, "color": "#555555", "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s2_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s2_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "AUTORIDAD", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Autoridad rapida. No te extiendas. 'Empece en mecatronica, pase a ciencia de datos, y llevo 3 anos full time construyendo con IA. Funde SaaS Factory Community, 700 miembros pagando, $72K procesados, sin publicidad, sin equipo. Todo con un sistema de IA. Y eso es lo que les vengo a mostrar.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "background": { "type": "solid", "color": "#0D0D0D" },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s3_main", "type": "text", "content": "No estoy aqu\u00ed para\nhablarles de mindset.", "x": 160, "y": 280, "width": 1600, "height": 200, "font_size": 64, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true, "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.2},
        {"id": "s3_sub", "type": "text", "content": "Les voy a mostrar un sistema real.", "x": 360, "y": 520, "width": 1200, "height": 50, "font_size": 32, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s3_bokeh1", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 200, "y": 60, "width": 100, "height": 100, "fill": "#f69f02", "opacity": 0.05},
        {"id": "s3_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s3_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "BUSINESS OS", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Pausa. 'No les voy a dar una charla de motivacion. Eso se lo dejo a otros. Lo que les voy a mostrar es un sistema corriendo en produccion que opera mi negocio. Van a ver por dentro como funciona.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "background": { "type": "gradient", "angle": 180, "stops": [{"offset": 0, "color": "#0D0D0D"}, {"offset": 1, "color": "#141414"}] },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s4_label", "type": "text", "content": "INTELLIGENCE EXPLOSION", "x": 160, "y": 80, "width": 800, "height": 28, "font_size": 14, "color": "#f69f02", "bold": true, "letter_spacing": 5},
        {"id": "s4_vbar", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 140, "y": 80, "width": 4, "height": 24, "fill": "#f69f02", "corner_radius": 2},
        {"id": "s4_title", "type": "text", "content": "La IA de hoy es la peor\nque vas a usar en tu vida.", "x": 160, "y": 260, "width": 1600, "height": 260, "font_size": 64, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true, "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.2},
        {"id": "s4_attr", "type": "text", "content": "\u2014 Alex Hormozi", "x": 560, "y": 550, "width": 800, "height": 40, "font_size": 24, "color": "#888888", "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s4_callout_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 280, "y": 700, "width": 1360, "height": 60, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 30, "stroke": {"color": "#333333", "width": 1}},
        {"id": "s4_callout_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\u26a1", "x": 310, "y": 710, "width": 40, "height": 40, "font_size": 22, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s4_callout_text", "type": "text", "content": "Si asumes cualquier tasa de mejora, aprender IA es tu prioridad #1, #2 y #3.", "x": 360, "y": 713, "width": 1200, "height": 34, "font_size": 16, "color": "#f69f02", "italic": true},
        {"id": "s4_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s4_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "INTELLIGENCE EXPLOSION", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Cita de Hormozi. 'Esto lo dijo Alex Hormozi y tiene razon. La IA que usamos hoy es la peor que vamos a usar jamas. Cada semana sale algo mejor. Y el que construya sistemas encima de esta ola, tiene una ventaja que se compone automaticamente. Eso es lo que hice.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "background": { "type": "solid", "color": "#0D0D0D" },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s5_main", "type": "text", "content": "Cada modelo nuevo amplifica\ntodo el sistema.", "x": 120, "y": 280, "width": 1680, "height": 200, "font_size": 56, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true, "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.2},
        {"id": "s5_sub", "type": "text", "content": "Sin esfuerzo extra. Zero effort compound.", "x": 360, "y": 520, "width": 1200, "height": 50, "font_size": 28, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s5_sub2", "type": "text", "content": "No necesito reescribir nada. El sistema se monta encima del crecimiento de la IA.", "x": 260, "y": 620, "width": 1400, "height": 60, "font_size": 22, "color": "#888888", "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s5_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s5_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "COMPOUND EFFECT", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Esta es la clave. 'Cuando salio Opus 4.6, no tuve que cambiar nada. Mi sistema se hizo mas inteligente automaticamente. Las metricas mejoraron, los agentes respondieron mejor, los analisis fueron mas profundos. Porque el sistema esta construido ENCIMA de la IA, no al lado de ella. Cada mejora de Anthropic es una mejora gratis para mi negocio.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "background": { "type": "solid", "color": "#0D0D0D" },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s6_main", "type": "text", "content": "OK. Pero, \u00bfqu\u00e9 es\nun Business OS?", "x": 160, "y": 300, "width": 1600, "height": 220, "font_size": 64, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true, "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.2},
        {"id": "s6_bokeh1", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 1500, "y": 100, "width": 150, "height": 150, "fill": "#8C27F1", "opacity": 0.05},
        {"id": "s6_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s6_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "EL SISTEMA", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Transicion. 'Ahora si. Les voy a explicar que es un Business OS. Y les voy a mostrar el mio por dentro.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "background": { "type": "gradient", "angle": 180, "stops": [{"offset": 0, "color": "#0D0D0D"}, {"offset": 1, "color": "#141414"}] },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s7_label", "type": "text", "content": "DEFINICI\u00d3N", "x": 160, "y": 80, "width": 400, "height": 28, "font_size": 14, "color": "#f69f02", "bold": true, "letter_spacing": 5},
        {"id": "s7_vbar", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 140, "y": 80, "width": 4, "height": 24, "fill": "#f69f02", "corner_radius": 2},
        {"id": "s7_title", "type": "text", "content": "Un agente de IA con acceso\na TODAS las variables\nde tu negocio.", "x": 160, "y": 180, "width": 1600, "height": 300, "font_size": 56, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true, "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.2},
        {"id": "s7_line", "type": "line", "x": 760, "y": 510, "width": 400, "height": 0, "x1": 760, "y1": 510, "x2": 1160, "y2": 510, "color": "#f69f02", "line_width": 2},
        {"id": "s7_sub", "type": "text", "content": "No es ChatGPT. No empieza de cero cada conversaci\u00f3n.\nSabe qui\u00e9n eres, tu negocio, tus m\u00e9tricas, tus errores.\nSiempre. 24/7.", "x": 260, "y": 550, "width": 1400, "height": 120, "font_size": 24, "color": "#BBBBBB", "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.5},
        {"id": "s7_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s7_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "EL SISTEMA", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Definicion. 'Un Business OS es un agente de IA que tiene acceso completo a tu negocio. No es un chatbot. No es ChatGPT donde le explicas todo desde cero. Es un agente que YA SABE todo. Mis metricas, mis clientes, mi calendario, mis errores pasados. Siempre. No importa si es lunes a las 9 o domingo a las 3 de la manana.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "background": { "type": "solid", "color": "#0D0D0D" },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s8_label", "type": "text", "content": "EL SISTEMA POR FUERA", "x": 160, "y": 60, "width": 600, "height": 28, "font_size": 14, "color": "#f69f02", "bold": true, "letter_spacing": 5},
        {"id": "s8_vbar", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 140, "y": 60, "width": 4, "height": 24, "fill": "#f69f02", "corner_radius": 2},
        {"id": "s8_title", "type": "text", "content": "Lo que el mundo ve", "x": 160, "y": 100, "width": 800, "height": 70, "font_size": 48, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true},
        {"id": "s8_c1_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 120, "y": 220, "width": 400, "height": 280, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 16, "stroke": {"color": "#f69f02", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#f69f02", "blur": 18, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s8_c1_icon_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 296, "y": 240, "width": 48, "height": 48, "fill": "#f69f02"},
        {"id": "s8_c1_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\u25b6", "x": 296, "y": 253, "width": 48, "height": 22, "font_size": 22, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c1_num", "type": "text", "content": "66 videos", "x": 140, "y": 310, "width": 360, "height": 50, "font_size": 36, "color": "#f69f02", "bold": true, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c1_lbl", "type": "text", "content": "YouTube como \u00danico canal\n727K+ vistas totales", "x": 140, "y": 365, "width": 360, "height": 60, "font_size": 18, "color": "#888888", "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.4},
        {"id": "s8_c2_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 560, "y": 220, "width": 400, "height": 280, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 16, "stroke": {"color": "#8C27F1", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#8C27F1", "blur": 18, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s8_c2_icon_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 736, "y": 240, "width": 48, "height": 48, "fill": "#8C27F1"},
        {"id": "s8_c2_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\ud83d\udc65", "x": 736, "y": 253, "width": 48, "height": 22, "font_size": 22, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c2_num", "type": "text", "content": "700+", "x": 580, "y": 310, "width": 360, "height": 50, "font_size": 36, "color": "#8C27F1", "bold": true, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c2_lbl", "type": "text", "content": "Miembros pagando cada mes\nSoftware propietario", "x": 580, "y": 365, "width": 360, "height": 60, "font_size": 18, "color": "#888888", "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.4},
        {"id": "s8_c3_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 1000, "y": 220, "width": 400, "height": 280, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 16, "stroke": {"color": "#00CC66", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#00CC66", "blur": 18, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s8_c3_icon_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 1176, "y": 240, "width": 48, "height": 48, "fill": "#00CC66"},
        {"id": "s8_c3_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\ud83e\udd16", "x": 1176, "y": 253, "width": 48, "height": 22, "font_size": 22, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c3_num", "type": "text", "content": "3 agentes IA", "x": 1020, "y": 310, "width": 360, "height": 50, "font_size": 36, "color": "#00CC66", "bold": true, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c3_lbl", "type": "text", "content": "Atendiendo 24/7\nTrinity, Sensei, Levy", "x": 1020, "y": 365, "width": 360, "height": 60, "font_size": 18, "color": "#888888", "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.4},
        {"id": "s8_c4_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 1440, "y": 220, "width": 400, "height": 280, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 16, "stroke": {"color": "#E74C3C", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#E74C3C", "blur": 18, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s8_c4_icon_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 1616, "y": 240, "width": 48, "height": 48, "fill": "#E74C3C"},
        {"id": "s8_c4_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\ud83d\udcb0", "x": 1616, "y": 253, "width": 48, "height": 22, "font_size": 22, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c4_num", "type": "text", "content": "$0 ads", "x": 1460, "y": 310, "width": 360, "height": 50, "font_size": 36, "color": "#E74C3C", "bold": true, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s8_c4_lbl", "type": "text", "content": "Cero empleados\nCero publicidad", "x": 1460, "y": 365, "width": 360, "height": 60, "font_size": 18, "color": "#888888", "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.4},
        {"id": "s8_bottom", "type": "text", "content": "Parece mucho para una persona sola. Porque lo es... si lo haces manualmente.", "x": 160, "y": 580, "width": 1600, "height": 50, "font_size": 26, "color": "#BBBBBB", "align": "center", "italic": true},
        {"id": "s8_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s8_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "EL SISTEMA POR FUERA", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "El sistema por fuera. 'Esto es lo que el mundo ve. 66 videos en YouTube, 700 miembros pagando, 3 agentes de IA atendiendo 24/7, y cero publicidad, cero empleados. Parece imposible para una persona sola. Y lo es, si lo haces manualmente. Pero yo no lo hago manualmente.'"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "background": { "type": "solid", "color": "#0D0D0D" },
      "elements": [
        {"id": "s9_main", "type": "text", "content": "Ahora les voy a mostrar\nlo que nadie ve.", "x": 160, "y": 300, "width": 1600, "height": 220, "font_size": 64, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true, "align": "center", "line_spacing": 1.2},
        {"id": "s9_sub", "type": "text", "content": "El sistema por dentro.", "x": 460, "y": 550, "width": 1000, "height": 50, "font_size": 32, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s9_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s9_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "EL SISTEMA POR DENTRO", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "Transicion dramatica. 'Todo lo anterior es lo que se ve desde afuera. Ahora les voy a abrir el cofre. Les voy a mostrar como funciona el motor.' Pausa."
    },
