        {"id": "s10_card2_desc", "type": "text", "content": "Revenue, MRR, churn, funnel,\nYouTube, comunidad.\nDatos reales, nunca fabricados.", "x": 780, "y": 290, "width": 440, "height": 100, "font_size": 18, "color": "#888888", "line_spacing": 1.4},
        {"id": "s10_card3_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 1280, "y": 220, "width": 540, "height": 200, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 16, "stroke": {"color": "#E74C3C", "width": 1}, "shadow": {"color": "#E74C3C", "blur": 15, "offset_x": 0, "offset_y": 0}},
        {"id": "s10_card3_icon_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "ellipse", "x": 1310, "y": 240, "width": 36, "height": 36, "fill": "#E74C3C"},
        {"id": "s10_card3_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\ud83d\udd12", "x": 1310, "y": 251, "width": 36, "height": 18, "font_size": 18, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s10_card3_title", "type": "text", "content": "Errores blindados", "x": 1360, "y": 243, "width": 440, "height": 30, "font_size": 22, "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true},
        {"id": "s10_card3_desc", "type": "text", "content": "Cada error documentado\nes un error que NUNCA\nse repite.", "x": 1360, "y": 290, "width": 440, "height": 100, "font_size": 18, "color": "#888888", "line_spacing": 1.4},
        {"id": "s10_callout_bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rounded_rect", "x": 280, "y": 500, "width": 1360, "height": 60, "fill": "#1a1a1a", "corner_radius": 30, "stroke": {"color": "#333333", "width": 1}},
        {"id": "s10_callout_icon", "type": "text", "content": "\ud83d\udca1", "x": 310, "y": 510, "width": 40, "height": 40, "font_size": 22, "align": "center"},
        {"id": "s10_callout_text", "type": "text", "content": "Cada vez que el agente se enciende, ya sabe TODO. No le explico nada.", "x": 360, "y": 513, "width": 1200, "height": 34, "font_size": 16, "color": "#f69f02", "italic": true},
        {"id": "s10_footer_left", "type": "text", "content": "DANIEL CARREON | SAAS FACTORY", "x": 120, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#555555"},
        {"id": "s10_footer_right", "type": "text", "content": "EL CEREBRO", "x": 1200, "y": 1020, "width": 600, "height": 24, "font_size": 11, "color": "#f69f02", "align": "right"}
      ],
      "notes": "El cerebro. 'Este es el corazon del sistema. Un archivo de 1,300 lineas que funciona como el system prompt permanente de mi agente. Contiene mi identidad completa, todas las metricas verificadas del negocio, y algo clave: cada error que hemos cometido esta documentado para que NUNCA se repita. Es como un empleado que nunca olvida nada y cada dia es mas inteligente que el anterior.'"
    },
